unitotem-manager (3.0.0~dev2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Qt6 + CEF viewer, multi-playlist scheduler, remote control and screen
    control
  * Updates page driven by unitotem-update (whole-image A/B updates), no apt
  * Loopback-only /health endpoint used to confirm a trial boot
  * Uploads moved to /var/lib/unitotem/uploaded (read-only root)
  * Depend on libxcb-icccm4 and libxcb-shape0 (Qt aborted the whole manager
    without them)
  * Disable a leftover haproxy, the manager binds 80/443 itself

